    - target: {fileID: 6829332510865142873, guid: d4722ab3c958a8a48a66ce554a801ca7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Kurulu\u015Fu 1300'l\xFC y\u0131llara dayanan, erken Osmanl\u0131 d\xF6nemi
        sivil mimari dokusunu korumu\u015F bir vak\u0131f k\xF6y\xFCd\xFCr. Ta\u015F,
        ah\u015Fap ve kerpi\xE7 kullan\u0131larak in\u015Fa edilen evleri ve \xF6zg\xFCn
        sokak yap\u0131s\u0131 ile UNESCO D\xFCnya Miras\u0131 Listesi'nde yer al\u0131r.
        Geleneksel Osmanl\u0131 k\xF6y yerle\u015Fiminin g\xFCn\xFCm\xFCze ula\u015Fm\u0131\u015F
        \xF6rne\u011Fidir."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
